msgid "Uses AV1, the latest generation codec with the best compression available. Produces the smallest files but encoding is slower. Ideal for archiving or uploading where size matters most."
msgstr "Uses AV1, the latest generation codec with the best compression available. Produces the smallest files but encoding is slower. Ideal for archiving or uploading where size matters most."

